{"id":"1a290c8b2ced7932","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-local-interpretability.md","title":"Finite Fragment Interpretability","display":"df-local-interpretability — Finite Fragment Interpretability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-local-interpretability","aliases":["67-df-local-interpretability"],"display":"df-local-interpretability — Finite Fragment Interpretability","depends_on":["[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","[[67-df-interpretability]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 5，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-local-interpretability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-local-interpretability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-interpretability — Finite Fragment Interpretability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 5，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright k\">\\(S\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span> 是本册为 Theorem 5 右侧采用的局部可解释性记号；不同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 可使用不同翻译。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{Int}(S\\upharpoonright k,T,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{Int}(S\\upharpoonright k,T,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>名称和符号是整理用的本地缩写；原书直接写“对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright k\\le T\">\\(S\\upharpoonright k\\le T\\)</span>”。这里不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\exists\\tau\">\\(\\forall k\\exists\\tau\\)</span> 偷换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\tau\\forall k\">\\(\\exists\\tau\\forall k\\)</span>。在一致且递归呈现的 PA 扩张中，两者通过 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e898bc916d99192\" href=\"?note=2e898bc916d99192\" title=\"67-thm-orey-compactness\">67-thm-orey-compactness</a> 等价；任意理论上并未作此承诺。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Theorem 5，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集；$\\unlhd$ 与 $\\mathrm{Int}$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]，$S\\upharpoonright k$ 取 [[67-df-finite-subtheory]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集；$\\unlhd$ 与 $\\mathrm{Int}$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]，$S\\upharpoonright k$ 取 [[67-df-finite-subtheory]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-orey-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"2e898bc916d99192","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"名称和符号是整理用的本地缩写；原书直接写“对每个 $k$，$S\\upharpoonright k\\le T$”。这里不把 $\\forall k\\exists\\tau$ 偷换成 $\\exists\\tau\\forall k$。在一致且递归呈现的 PA 扩张中，两者通过 [[67-thm-orey-compactness]] 等价；任意理论上并未作此承诺。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\upharpoonright k","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{Int}(S\\upharpoonright k,T,\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"S\\upharpoonright k\\le T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k\\exists\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\tau\\forall k","display":false}],"bytes":1559,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e898bc916d99192","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\unlhd$、$\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}$ 与 $S\\upharpoonright k$ 分别取 [[67-df-interpretability]]、[[67-df-local-interpretability]]、[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-local-interpretability]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-local-interpretability]]"}],"outgoing":["650dc4b8018183d7","44cd21d3d12e4d8d","2e898bc916d99192"]}